  "summary": "Malicious code in allyspin-casino (npm)",
  "details": "Allyspin-casino@1.0.0 is an inert npm package published under the AllySpin Casino brand. It ships no executable code: the sole module (index.js) is an empty export, there are no install/lifecycle scripts, no binaries, and no dependencies. The package consists only of a French-language casino-review README that promotes the site allyspin-fr[.]fr. It is a placeholder/SEO-spam package with no functional payload in this version.",
